# The device image only runs the Python app. Everything else in the repo —
# above all widget/node_modules, which CI populates before the image build —
# used to ride along in the one layer that changes on every release, so each
# update re-downloaded ~80 MB. Allowlist what the image needs instead.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# hatchling reads the readme named in pyproject.toml when installing the project
!README.md
!src
!packages
# the local simulator stack points CONFIG_FP at this file inside the image
!simulators
simulators/*
!simulators/app_config.json

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
